  "finalText": "I cancelled the wireless mouse line on O-2003 and refunded it to Marcus's card. The other two lines are untouched.\n\n- **Cancelled:** line L1, 2 × Wireless Mouse (P-MOU). It was still pending and had not shipped. The hub (L2) and cables (L3) are unchanged and still pending.\n- **Refunded:** 7,350 cents (£73.50) to the original card, recorded as refund RF-1. That is what he actually paid for the line, which was less than the 9,800 list price because of the MOUSE25 discount.\n- **Restocked:** 2 units of P-MOU, taking stock from 30 to 32. The order showed no sign of a backorder, so I treated the line as having stock set aside.\n\nI re-checked the order afterwards and it shows these changes.",
